1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:03,800
Every serious scheduling application
hits the same wall:

2
00:00:03,800 --> 00:00:06,200
thousands of activities,
hundreds of resources,

3
00:00:06,200 --> 00:00:08,400
and a timeline that has to
stay readable.

4
00:00:08,600 --> 00:00:11,800
FlexGanttFX is the leading
Gantt chart framework for JavaFX —

5
00:00:11,800 --> 00:00:14,400
a domain-independent foundation

6
00:00:14,400 --> 00:00:18,000
for anything from project planning
to industrial scheduling.

7
00:00:18,400 --> 00:00:21,600
Rendering runs on canvas
with a buffer architecture,

8
00:00:21,600 --> 00:00:24,600
so tens of thousands of activities

9
00:00:24,600 --> 00:00:27,400
scroll and zoom at
sixty frames per second.

10
00:00:27,400 --> 00:00:30,000
No virtualization compromises,
no stutter.

11
00:00:30,400 --> 00:00:32,800
Every visual detail is yours.

12
00:00:32,800 --> 00:00:36,200
Pluggable renderers, a layer system,
and CSS styling let you

13
00:00:36,200 --> 00:00:39,000
match your domain and your brand.

14
00:00:39,000 --> 00:00:42,000
The timeline spans
milliseconds to decades,

15
00:00:42,000 --> 00:00:45,000
with multi-row datelines
and configurable zoom.

16
00:00:45,400 --> 00:00:48,600
Dual, quad, and multi-chart containers

17
00:00:48,600 --> 00:00:51,400
keep complex resource views
synchronized.

18
00:00:51,400 --> 00:00:54,400
Activity links model dependencies
between tasks

19
00:00:54,400 --> 00:00:57,000
and render them as curved
or straight arrows.

20
00:00:57,500 --> 00:00:59,800
And it deploys everywhere.

21
00:00:59,800 --> 00:01:02,600
The same codebase runs on the
desktop with JavaFX,

22
00:01:02,600 --> 00:01:04,400
in the browser via JPro,

23
00:01:04,400 --> 00:01:07,200
and natively on iOS and Android
with GraalVM and Gluon.

24
00:01:07,400 --> 00:01:10,000
Over a decade in production,
eleven major versions,

25
00:01:10,000 --> 00:01:12,200
and more than 110 enterprise customers

26
00:01:12,200 --> 00:01:14,400
— including Emirates, NASA, and Boeing.

27
00:01:14,400 --> 00:01:17,000
FlexGanttFX.
Start building at flexganttfx.com
